\section{Scope — EIA / YVA only (no SEA)}{

\strong{This handler delivers EIA (YVA) records only.} The ymparisto.fi search
index has no SOVA / SEA (\emph{suunnitelmien ja ohjelmien vaikutusten arviointi})
content type — \code{yva_project} is the only project type in the register — so
there is no plan/programme-level strategic assessment to fetch here. The
\code{assessment_type} argument therefore accepts only \code{"All"} / \code{"EIA"} (both
meaning the same thing); there is no \code{"SEA"} path. If a Finnish SOVA/SEA
register surfaces later it would be a separate handler.
